Wh-Why...?

00:13:50.956 --> 00:13:53.208
I'm a fan of your show.

00:13:53.208 --> 00:13:54.751
I record it every week.

00:13:54.751 --> 00:13:55.627
What?!

00:13:55.627 --> 00:13:58.005
Mainly for Roko's scenes.

00:13:59.298 --> 00:14:02.384
That's why I was looking forward to today.

00:14:02.384 --> 00:14:06.597
I get to see Roko--I mean, Fruit Tart live.

00:14:06.597 --> 00:14:08.891
Y-You don't have to see us!

00:14:08.891 --> 00:14:10.767
I know you just want to tease me.

00:14:10.767 --> 00:14:12.352
What's that camera for, anyway?!

00:14:12.352 --> 00:14:15.397
Oh, please. I can't do that
to my beloved sister.

00:14:15.397 --> 00:14:17.983
Cream Anmitsu, please standby!

00:14:17.983 --> 00:14:19.651
Okay!

00:14:19.651 --> 00:14:21.528
See you girls later!

00:14:21.528 --> 00:14:24.323
All right, I'll see you later.

00:14:24.323 --> 00:14:26.533
Good luck with your show... Big sis!

00:14:26.533 --> 00:14:28.076
Hurry up and go!

00:14:28.076 --> 00:14:30.037
Ah, I shot some good footage...

00:14:30.037 --> 00:14:33.332
But you might want to put on your skirt soon.

00:14:35.542 --> 00:14:37.753
She's so aggravating as always!

00:14:37.753 --> 00:14:39.129
There, there.

00:14:39.129 --> 00:14:43.675
But isn't it great that they're
watching our show, too?

00:14:46.637 --> 00:14:51.016
I'd love to have a fan like Miss Chiko one day.

00:14:54.394 --> 00:14:58.065
Look at this, Inocchi! We got lots of gifts!

00:14:58.065 --> 00:14:59.942
Wow, that's amazing!

00:14:59.942 --> 00:15:02.569
Thank you so much, neighbors!

00:15:02.569 --> 00:15:04.905
Look! We've got all sorts of sweets, too!

00:15:04.905 --> 00:15:08.534
Wow! These are Koganei Puffs,
known for their miraculous fluffiness!

00:15:08.534 --> 00:15:11.078
We got Koganei Cheesecake, too!

00:15:11.078 --> 00:15:15.749
Cake, <i>baumkuchen</i>, <i>dango</i>,
and Mitten's cream puffs!

00:15:15.749 --> 00:15:17.918
This is royal treatment!

00:15:17.918 --> 00:15:20.754
Idols are something else, right, Inocchi?!

00:15:22.214 --> 00:15:22.923
"Former unpopular musician"
Oh, Hayu...?

00:15:22.923 --> 00:15:26.552
"Former unpopular musician"
I've never been treated this way before, ever!

00:15:26.552 --> 00:15:28.428
"Former unpopular musician"
So it makes me so happy...

00:15:28.428 --> 00:15:29.972
"Former unpopular musician"
Hayu!

00:15:29.972 --> 00:15:32.683
Hey there, are you girls all prepared?

00:15:32.683 --> 00:15:34.309
Oh, Miss Riri!

00:15:34.309 --> 00:15:37.145
Huh? But that outfit...

00:15:37.145 --> 00:15:38.605
Did you notice?

00:15:38.605 --> 00:15:42.734
I'm actually going to be hosting today's event.

00:15:42.734 --> 00:15:43.652
What?!

00:15:43.652 --> 00:15:46.530
I'm the one who put Fruit Tart on the bill, too.

00:15:46.530 --> 00:15:48.073
But we don't have a budget.

00:15:48.073 --> 00:15:50.534
So I'm sorry that I'm not
a more professional host.

00:15:50.534 --> 00:15:53.370
Oh, you've done so much for us! And the cosplay!

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:54.705
Thank you very much!

00:15:54.705 --> 00:15:55.706
Don't worry.

00:15:55.706 --> 00:15:57.499
It's totally fine.

00:15:57.499 --> 00:15:59.793
She's the type who gets excited being seen.

00:15:59.793 --> 00:16:00.836
What?!

00:16:02.796 --> 00:16:04.715
So anyway...

00:16:04.715 --> 00:16:08.927
Quit dawdling and go on!

00:16:08.927 --> 00:16:12.264
The audience is eager to see you girls.

00:16:12.264 --> 00:16:14.558
Y-Y-Y-You're absolutely right.

00:16:14.558 --> 00:16:17.227
They're all here to see us.

00:16:17.227 --> 00:16:20.189
We can't make them wait any longer!

00:16:20.189 --> 00:16:21.690
Are you okay, Ino?

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:24.651
You seem like you're really nervous.

00:16:24.651 --> 00:16:27.696
What?! N-No! I-I-I-I'm totally fine!

00:16:27.696 --> 00:16:29.072
I just...

00:16:29.072 --> 00:16:31.658
...r-really need to pee!

00:16:31.658 --> 00:16:32.993
Hurry up and go!

00:16:36.413 --> 00:16:37.706
What a relief.

00:16:37.706 --> 00:16:39.708
I'm a lot calmer now.

00:16:39.708 --> 00:16:40.167
"Nervous pee-er"

00:16:40.167 --> 00:16:41.710
"Nervous pee-er"
But what should I do?

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:46.256
"Nervous pee-er"
I'm getting so nervous
now that we're about to perform.

00:16:46.256 --> 00:16:48.258
Am I worried about it?

00:16:48.258 --> 00:16:50.552
I can't let everyone down...

00:16:50.552 --> 00:16:52.930
Um, Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:16:53.889 --> 00:16:54.765
Hey!

00:16:54.765 --> 00:16:55.807
Hemo?

00:16:55.807 --> 00:16:57.643
You're so far away!

00:16:57.643 --> 00:16:59.186
U-Um...

00:16:59.186 --> 00:17:01.188
I'm sorry to be so abrupt.

00:17:01.188 --> 00:17:05.859
I wanted to support you as a junior idol myself.

00:17:05.859 --> 00:17:07.194
What?

00:17:07.194 --> 00:17:08.529
Really?

00:17:08.529 --> 00:17:11.573
Thank you very much! That makes me so happy!

00:17:11.573 --> 00:17:14.660
Oh, but how did you know my name...?

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:17.704
I-I got it from Producer Riri.

00:17:17.704 --> 00:17:19.373
I've also seen your information
on the show website, too.

00:17:19.373 --> 00:17:20.999
"Birthday: April 4th"
"Height 155 cm" "Blood type: O"
I've also seen your information
on the show website, too.

00:17:20.999 --> 00:17:24.002
Leave it to me! I'll pray for your happiness!

00:17:24.002 --> 00:17:27.589
What?! I don't recall ever saying such a thing!

00:17:27.589 --> 00:17:29.925
I didn't even know about the site...

00:17:29.925 --> 00:17:31.051
How embarrassing...

00:17:31.051 --> 00:17:36.723
Oh, but it's true that you dreamed of becoming
an idol ever since you were little, right?

00:17:36.723 --> 00:17:37.724
Yes.

00:17:37.724 --> 00:17:39.476
That is true.

00:17:39.476 --> 00:17:42.229
U-Um, it's true for me, too!

00:17:42.229 --> 00:17:45.607
I also dreamed of becoming an idol
ever since I was little!

00:17:45.607 --> 00:17:49.570
I wanted to see if I would change
if I ever became an idol.

00:17:50.571 --> 00:17:56.159
That's why I want you to do great
for your first concert, Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:17:56.159 --> 00:18:02.207
I know these words don't sound
too convincing since we just met today...

00:18:03.041 --> 00:18:06.170
But I wanted to support you, even just a little.

00:18:07.379 --> 00:18:10.424
That's not true... Thank you, Hemo!

00:18:10.424 --> 00:18:13.594
I feel empowered now!

00:18:14.553 --> 00:18:17.931
I'll sing my heart out for you, too, Hemo!

00:18:17.931 --> 00:18:20.475
So please watch our stage.

00:18:20.475 --> 00:18:22.895
I'll make sure it's a wonderful concert!

00:18:22.895 --> 00:18:24.146
Goodbye for now!

00:18:27.399 --> 00:18:29.276
Yes, that's right!

00:18:29.276 --> 00:18:31.612
I want to be an idol!

00:18:31.612 --> 00:18:35.949
I've dreamed of becoming an idol
ever since I was little!

00:18:35.949 --> 00:18:39.244
I'm about to realize my dream to be up on stage!

00:18:39.244 --> 00:18:41.580
I can't be nervous about it!

00:18:42.497 --> 00:18:45.834
Remember the feeling from when I was little!

00:18:48.295 --> 00:18:52.633
Fruit Tart will now perform their new song!

00:18:52.633 --> 00:18:56.136
A-All right... Let's go, everyone!

00:18:56.136 --> 00:18:58.055
U-Um!

00:18:58.055 --> 00:19:00.140
Roko-<i>sempai</i>.

00:19:00.140 --> 00:19:02.059
Hayu.

00:19:02.059 --> 00:19:04.394
Nina-<i>sempai</i>.

00:19:04.394 --> 00:19:07.189
There's no need to be nervous!

00:19:07.189 --> 00:19:11.109
We've been working hard as idols all this time!

00:19:11.109 --> 00:19:12.110
Ino...

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:13.862
--Inocchi...
--Ino...

00:19:13.862 --> 00:19:15.948
Yeah, you're right!

00:19:15.948 --> 00:19:17.908
We've tackled so many ridiculous situations.

00:19:17.908 --> 00:19:19.618
This is nothing!

00:19:21.245 --> 00:19:24.873
All right! Here we go again!

00:19:24.873 --> 00:19:26.500
Yeah!

00:21:19.029 --> 00:21:20.239
Ino...

00:21:22.616 --> 00:21:24.576
It's amazing...

00:21:24.576 --> 00:21:26.078
What idols can do...

00:21:29.748 --> 00:21:31.667
Yes.

00:21:31.667 --> 00:21:32.876
Yes!

00:23:05.093 --> 00:23:07.721
"After the concert"

00:23:08.013 --> 00:23:09.014
Huh?

00:23:09.014 --> 00:23:09.890
Where's Ino?

00:23:09.890 --> 00:23:12.267
She seemed to be in a rush...

00:23:12.267 --> 00:23:15.812
Oh... She went to the bathroom
because she wet herself.

00:23:15.812 --> 00:23:18.607
I did not wet myself!

00:23:25.405 --> 00:23:30.285
"PREVIEW"
All right! Next on <i>Dropout Idol Fruit Tart</i>!

00:23:30.285 --> 00:23:31.203
Hayu here!

00:23:31.203 --> 00:23:33.664
Our first concert was so much fun!

00:23:33.664 --> 00:23:37.209
Next time, a new member joins Fruit Tart!

00:23:37.209 --> 00:23:40.629
And what?! We're doing a swimsuit shoot
for a promotional ad?

00:23:40.629 --> 00:23:43.298
I don't feel confident about it at all!

00:23:43.298 --> 00:23:45.259
"A New Face!"
<i>Dropout Idol Fruit Tart</i>!

00:23:45.259 --> 00:23:47.553
"A New Face!"
Episode 4: A New Face!

00:23:47.553 --> 00:23:50.102
"A New Face!"
See you next time!
